    {
      "source": "<code>AotTestExecutionListener</code> is an extension of the <a href=\"../TestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>TestExecutionListener</code></a>\nSPI that allows a listener to optionally provide ahead-of-time (AOT) support.",
      "translation": "<code>AotTestExecutionListener</code> 是 <a href=\"../TestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>TestExecutionListener</code></a> SPI 的扩展，允许监听器可选地提供提前编译（AOT）支持。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Process the supplied test class ahead-of-time using the given\n<a href=\"../../../aot/hint/RuntimeHints.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aot.hint\"><code>RuntimeHints</code></a> instance.",
